                <head>No. 25.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hassinger’s certificate.</hi></head>
                <p>I certify that the [following] tabular statement hereon made is correct, and is
                    taken from the naturalization records of the interior department.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">J. A. Hassinger</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Chief Cleric of Department</hi>.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Honolulu, Hawaiian Islands</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1893-06-20"><hi rendition="#italic">June 20,
                                1893</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>












